            "quote": "func clampQuality(value, fallback int) int {\n\tif value == 0 {\n\t\treturn fallback\n\t}\n\n\tif value < 1 {\n\t\treturn 1\n\t}\n\n\tif value > 100 {\n\t\treturn 100\n\t}\n\n\treturn value\n}",
